		*SOUND ls08_06
	}
	*101 
	{
		*TEXT "站住！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_08
	}
	*102 
	{
		*TEXT "停下！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_09
	}
	*103 
	{
		*TEXT "继续前进。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_10
	}
	*104 
	{
		*TEXT "欢迎来到梅克伦"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_11
	}
	*105 
	{
		*TEXT "任何人都不可以在"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_12
	}
	*106 
	{
		*TEXT "先在竞技场证明自己之前见我们的首领！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND 
	}
	*108 
	{
		*TEXT "陌生人，进入竞技场，证明你的价值吧！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_14
	}
	*110 
	{
		*TEXT "你已经证明了你的价值，陌生人。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_15
	}
	*111 
	{
		*TEXT "我们的首领会与你交谈。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND 
	}
	*112 
	{
		*TEXT "你战斗得非常英勇，阿莱克托现在要见你。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_16
	}
	*114 
	{
		*TEXT "你需要气体容器。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_17
	}
	*115 
	{
		*TEXT "你需要给容器加满气体燃料。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ls08_18
	}
	*117 
	{
		*TEXT "一切荣耀归于帝国！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND ge_ancestor119
	}
	*118 
	{
		*TEXT "是的。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor001
	}
	*119 
	{
		*TEXT "不。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor002
	}
	*120 
	{
		*TEXT "嗯。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor003
	}
	*121 
	{
		*TEXT "不客气。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor004
	}
	*122 
	{
		*TEXT "很好。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor005
	}
	*123 
	{
		*TEXT "对。"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
		*SOUND gen_ancestor006
	}
	*124 
	{
		*TEXT "别让他们跑了！"
		*SUBTITLEDURATION 3
